Z||000010||MinnGreenGT||12-10-2001||11:25 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by maryjane:<BR><B>Rob: For some unknown reason, I figured you for a green color. Don't know where I got that.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, Green would be great too, but it'd have to be the right color green- and I couldn't tweak it to the dark green in 30 seconds or less  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I saw a Ferrari 246 Dino that was Dark Green with the tan interior... tried <B>really</B> hard to get my Dad to buy it (he was casually looking at 246's)- but no such luck.<P>As much as I love my green, if I had a Ferrari (real or otherwise), It'd probably have to be black, yellow, or as a last resort: red.||||reg||1
